  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your prowess with ranged attacks is legendary.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Improved Precise Shot<sup>CRB</sup>, 5th mythic tier.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you make a ranged attack, you automatically hit your target (regardless of its AC) on a natural roll of 17 or better (the d20 roll shows a 17, 18, 19, or 20). This is treated as if you had rolled a natural 20 on the attack, although your attack is not a critical threat unless the die roll actually rolls within your attack’s threat range.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc180\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
